  title: Day 1
  winSubtitle: I made it through the first day.
  loseSubtitle: Not today.
  winThoughts:
  - I drank slowly. Small sips.
  - Somewhere above, people are looking for us.
  - Tomorrow I'll look for the way out.
  loseThoughts:
  - The darkness was too heavy today.
  - I'll rest. Tomorrow I'll try again.
